OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASchool awarded funding to restore
OL,4,Arare pipe organ
OL,5,
OL,6,FA west London school has raised more
OL,7,Fthan #327,000 with help from the
OL,8,FNational Lottery Heritage Fund to
OL,9,Frestore a rare pipe organ that was
OL,10,Fsmuggled from Paris to London more than
OL,11,Fa century ago.
OL,13,FThe instrument at Sacred Heart High
OL,14,FSchool, Hammersmith, was built by
OL,15,FBelgian craftsman Hippolyte Loret and
OL,16,Fwas smuggled out of Paris in 1904 to
OL,17,Fstop it being seized by the French
OL,18,Fgovernment.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
