OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASchool awarded funding to restore
OL,4,Arare pipe organ
OL,5,
OL,6,FIts history was uncovered after organ
OL,7,Fexpert Dr William McVicker visited the
OL,8,Fschool's Grade II*-listed chapel in
OL,9,F2024 to check the instrument's
OL,10,Fcondition.
OL,12,FThe two-year restoration project starts
OL,13,Fthis month, with the organ being
OL,14,Fremoved and restored by Mander Organ
OL,15,FBuilders before its reinstallation in
OL,16,FAugust 2027.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
